### Does a typos exclusion hold when prek names the file?

- `typos -w  CHANGELOG.md` with `extend-exclude`: file now `A receive entry.`
- `typos -w --force-exclude CHANGELOG.md` with `extend-exclude`: file now `A recieve entry.`
